+      # loadFileCrc's verbose hint (92-99); 98 for wip/'s checkBl draft.
+      # loadBlFiles' type-11 block is laid out by frequencies no guessed
+      # profile gives (dom2's FSM threader zeroes it; wip/README.md): it comes
